      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-12-19_WidnesExaminer_art0180" n="art0180">
        <p>THE EXAMINER, SATURDAY, DECEMBER 19, 1914.</p>
        <p>IMME X:10 JEC 4C CP 311VK I\T</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-12-19_WidnesExaminer_art0181" n="art0181">
        <head>SPORT.</head>
        <p>SPORT.</p>
        <p>ASSOCIATION.</p>
        <p>TEAMS FOR TO-DAY.</p>
        <p>EMMANUEL INSTITUTE v. SANKEY ATHLETIC.</p>
        <p>In Victoria Park :</p>
        <p>Emmanuel : W. Knight; E. Crozier and S. Hughes; T. Hughes, E. Hardy and W. Ayres; A. Oakes, G. Done, S. Roberts (captain), A. Bevan and William Eaton. ,</p>
