        <p>Elmwood: A. Holt; James Phcenix and Jos. Phenix (captain); Jos. Pritchard, E. B. Mellor and W. Hall; W. Phcenix, W. C. Ashton, R. Kendrick, T. Wells and Jos. Smith.</p>
        <p>iLMWOOD-AVENUE RESERVES v. PADGATE UNITED. , M Padgate; kick-off 2.45 p.m.:— Padgate: E. TJnsworth; IL TJnsworth and Taylor; Pass, Cartwright and Williams; Hard- man, ChaHoner, Ball, Yates and Woods.</p>
        <p>Elm. wood : H. Main; R. Wallington and Jas. Mellor; H. Challoner, J. Hamblett and W. Littlewood; H. L. Clayton, H. Norke, K. Ken- drick, E. Darbyshire, and A. Lamb (captain). Reserves: T. Hunt, P. Podmore and N. Ellam. PADDINGTON v. FAIRFIELD UNITED.</p>
        <p>At Paddington; kick-off 2.30 Paddington: J. Harrison; E. Holmes (capt.) and W. Chamberlain; W. Holmes, J. Taylor and W. Spencer; T. Wainwright, W. Garnett, J. Darbyshire, C. Smith and J. Bramhall. Re- serves: J. Holcroft and J. Pritchard. PADDINGTON RESERVE v. WARRINGTON</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-12-19_WidnesExaminer_art0182" n="art0182">
        <head>CENTRAL.</head>
