        <p>GRA tIPENH AL L• Old Scholars' Reunion.—The Grappenhall Old Scholars' Association held their annual reunion in the schoolroom on Saturday evening, when, following a reception, an enjoyable programme of musical and other items was gone through. Mr. F. Parr contributed two violin solos and a recitation, and Mr. S. Reece a violin solo, whilst songs were.rendered by the Misses M. Foden and B. Taylor. Miss Fairhurst recited, Miss Butterworth was the accompanist, and Mr. Wilmot Ashton occupied the chair.</p>
